   133	
   134	For orientation, the first sector eigenvalues are
   135	\[
   136	\begin{array}{c|ccc}
   137	n&\lambda_{\rm std}&\lambda_{\rm sym}&\lambda_{\rm anti}\\ \hline
   138	3&1/11&---&1/9\\
   139	4&87/640&3/208&57/640\\
   140	5&8585/57314&359/26660&143/2100.
   141	\end{array}                                                  \tag{4.12}\label{4.12}
   142	\]
   143	These are the Frobenius-normalized quadratic eigenvalues; they are checks,
