\begin{lemma}[finite exact symmetric-sector certificate]
\label{lem:symmetric-finite}
The scalar $\mathcal S_N$ is positive for $3\le N\le39$.  For each of the
248 integer orders $40\le N\le287$,
$\beta_N+\varepsilon_N<1$; the smallest certified margin occurs at $N=40$
