\end{proof}

For $N\ge288$, induction in \eqref{A.20} gives
$t_j\ge N/(N-j+\sqrt{N/2})$.  Indeed, substituting the inductive bound leaves
the numerator
$2u(N-j+u)+u-N$, where $u=\sqrt{N/2}$; it is minimized at $j=N-1$ and
